---
// Coaching & Trainers Spotlight Component - Nexus Fitness Court
---

<section id="coach" class="coach-section" aria-labelledby="coach-heading">
  <div class="container coach-grid">
    <!-- Coach Visual Card -->
    <div class="coach-visual-col">
      <div class="coach-card glass-card">
        <div class="coach-image-wrapper">
          <img 
            src="/images/coach-marcus.jpg" 
            alt="Certified Personal Trainer at Nexus Fitness Court Besa Nagpur" 
            width="550" 
            height="550" 
            loading="lazy"
            class="coach-img"
          />
          <div class="coach-img-overlay"></div>
          <div class="coach-logo-stamp">
            <img 
              src="/images/nexus-logo.svg" 
              alt="Nexus Fitness Court Seal" 
              width="60" 
              height="60" 
              class="stamp-img"
            />
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="coach-card-badge">
          <div>
            <span class="badge-title">Expert Coaching Team</span>
            <span class="badge-sub">Certified Trainers &bull; Nexus Fitness Court</span>
          </div>
          <span class="badge-cert">BESA • NAGPUR</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Coach Info & Bio -->
    <div class="coach-content-col">
      <div class="badge-nexus">
        CERTIFIED COACHING & FLOOR GUIDANCE
      </div>

      <h2 id="coach-heading" class="coach-title">
        DEDICATED COACHES COMMITTED TO YOUR <span class="text-nexus">TRANSFORMATION.</span>
      </h2>

      <p class="coach-lead">
        Nexus Fitness Court was founded at Om Enclave, Besa Road with one uncompromising mission: to give Nagpur a premier unisex fitness space where members build real strength, drop stubborn body fat, and train in an uplifting environment.
      </p>

      <p class="coach-bio">
        Whether you are stepping into a gym for the first time or want to break personal lifting PRs, our certified trainers guide you directly on our gym floor. We focus on <strong>biomechanically correct lifting form, progressive overload, and realistic Indian nutrition</strong> tailored for busy lifestyles.
      </p>

      <!-- Checklist Points -->
      <div class="credentials-list">
        <div class="credential-item">
          <div class="check-icon">
            <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
          </div>
          <span><strong>Commercial Gymquip Machinery:</strong> High-precision plate-loaded and selectorized stations designed for isolated muscular tension and joint safety.</span>
        </div>

        <div class="credential-item">
          <div class="check-icon">
            <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
          </div>
          <span><strong>Active Floor Presence:</strong> Trainers are actively present on the gym floor every session to correct posture, spot heavy sets, and answer training queries.</span>
        </div>

        <div class="credential-item">
          <div class="check-icon">
            <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
          </div>
          <span><strong>Tailored Indian Nutrition Plans:</strong> Science-backed macronutrient charts that incorporate lentils, paneer, eggs, chicken, and local home meals without extreme starvation.</span>
        </div>

        <div class="credential-item">
          <div class="check-icon">
            <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
          </div>
          <span><strong>Inclusive Unisex Atmosphere:</strong> A safe, friendly, ego-free community for beginners, women, corporate professionals, and serious lifters across Besa & South Nagpur.</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="coach-cta-box">
        <a href="#book-call" class="btn-primary">
          <span>Book Free Consultation at Gym</span>
          <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><path d="M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .coach-section {
    padding: 6.5rem 0;
    position: relative;
    background: #090a0f;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
  }
  .coach-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: 4rem;
    align-items: center;
  }
  @media (min-width: 960px) {
    .coach-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 0.9fr 1.1fr;
      gap: 5rem;
    }
  }

  /* Coach Card */
  .coach-card {
    background: var(--bg-surface);
    border-radius: var(--radius-xl);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
    overflow: hidden;
    box-shadow: 0 20px 50px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.7);
  }
  .coach-image-wrapper {
    position: relative;
    aspect-ratio: 1 / 1;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .coach-img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    display: block;
    transition: transform 0.6s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);
  }
  .coach-card:hover .coach-img {
    transform: scale(1.03);
  }
  .coach-img-overlay {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background: linear-gradient(to top, var(--bg-surface) 0%, transparent 40%);
  }

  .coach-logo-stamp {
    position: absolute;
    top: 1.25rem;
    right: 1.25rem;
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    overflow: hidden;
    border: 1px solid var(--primary);
    box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(234, 179, 8, 0.35);
    background: #08090d;
    padding: 6px;
  }
  .stamp-img {
    display: block;
    width: 50px;
    height: auto;
  }

  .coach-card-badge {
    padding: 1.25rem 1.75rem;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    background: var(--bg-surface);
  }
  .badge-title {
    display: block;
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    color: #ffffff;
    font-weight: 700;
  }
  .badge-sub {
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    color: var(--text-dim);
  }
  .badge-cert {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    padding: 0.35rem 0.75rem;
    background: rgba(234, 179, 8, 0.12);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-nexus);
    color: var(--primary);
    border-radius: var(--radius-pill);
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
  }

  /* Coach Content */
  .coach-title {
    font-size: 2.25rem;
    line-height: 1.12;
    margin-top: 1.25rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }
  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    .coach-title {
      font-size: 3.2rem;
    }
  }

  .coach-lead {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: #ffffff;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }
  .coach-bio {
    font-size: 0.98rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }
  .coach-bio strong {
    color: #ffffff;
  }

  .credentials-list {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1rem;
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
  }
  .credential-item {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 0.85rem;
    font-size: 0.92rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.5;
  }
  .credential-item strong {
    color: #ffffff;
  }
  .check-icon {
    width: 24px;
    height: 24px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: rgba(234, 179, 8, 0.15);
    color: var(--primary);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    margin-top: 2px;
  }

  .coach-cta-box {
    display: flex;
  }
</style>
